        "text": "# 国内差旅报销规定\n\n"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "136e603a41384ad480edd8076438a085:E2",
        "doc_id": "D01",
        "title": "差旅报销规定 D01",
        "version_date": "2026-01-01",
        "content_hash": "3abaa9b76772582fde4b98bd8c2090b1ad875bd8b8241fe0fe8ec369cb65d872",
        "section_id": "D01-S0002",
        "section_heading": "一、用途与适用事项",
        "heading_span": {
          "start": 15,
          "end": 24
        },
        "chunk_id": "D01-C0002",
        "source_span": {
          "start": 12,
          "end": 59
        },
        "text": "## 一、用途与适用事项\n\n本规定说明员工国内差旅报销的提交期限，以及报销申请的处理状态。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "136e603a41384ad480edd8076438a085:E3",
        "doc_id": "D01",
        "title": "差旅报销规定 D01",
        "version_date": "2026-01-01",
        "content_hash": "3abaa9b76772582fde4b98bd8c2090b1ad875bd8b8241fe0fe8ec369cb65d872",
        "section_id": "D01-S0003",
        "section_heading": "二、提交期限",
        "heading_span": {
          "start": 62,
          "end": 68
        },
        "chunk_id": "D01-C0003",
        "source_span": {
          "start": 59,
          "end": 122
        },
        "text": "## 二、提交期限\n\n1. 国内差旅报销须在行程结束后 20 天内提交。\n2. 报销申请的处理状态与上述提交期限分别记录。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "136e603a41384ad480edd8076438a085:E4",
        "doc_id": "D01",
        "title": "差旅报销规定 D01",
        "version_date": "2026-01-01",
        "content_hash": "3abaa9b76772582fde4b98bd8c2090b1ad875bd8b8241fe0fe8ec369cb65d872",
        "section_id": "D01-S0004",
        "section_heading": "三、申请状态说明",
        "heading_span": {
          "start": 125,
          "end": 133
        },
        "chunk_id": "D01-C0004",
        "source_span": {
          "start": 122,
          "end": 221
        },
        "text": "## 三、申请状态说明\n\n1. “已提交”表示申请已进入处理队列，不代表审核通过。\n2. “处理中”表示申请仍在审核，不能据此认定已完成付款。\n3. 员工查询处理进度时，应区分申请状态与付款状态。\n"
      }
